    {
      "id": "coalesced:3b48305b2be8b23f317880d537cef1df922359e5f41e33dff7425af5017256c4",
      "source": "전 라티 족을 도저히 용서할 수 없어요.\\n제 남편의 원수를...",
      "source_sha256": "27c2f7c5f1aea15ad872ca350fa19f2b838f77d0d42a34c8b7c772d45559900c",
      "before_translation": "我实在没法原谅拉提族。杀害我丈夫的仇人……",
      "translation": "我实在没法原谅拉提族。我丈夫的仇……",
      "translation_sha256": "bb3a0893e33f75643b897b3a561847820d20a6c424018b710519d2f99017558e",
      "reason": "Korean제남편의원수를 leaves the revenge object and predicate unfinished,not a completed killer noun phrase. Retain husband revenge ellipsis as我丈夫的仇 without adding a verb or murderer identity. Parallel JPN夫の仇を討ちます supports revenge topic but its explicit vow must not overwrite INTellipsis. Seven controls preserve explicit killing,unconfirmed relatives and separate spouse quarrel.",
      "status": "source-grounded-draft-correction"
    }
  ],
  "retained_family_controls": [
    {
      "id": "coalesced:be60f8b56bf6b78134fbdcc81d4328d82df60cc9d89242dcbf46ba1cd2c2e46c",
      "source": "하여간 이게 다 슈엔자이트 그 자가\\n여왕 폐하를 시해했기 때문이지.",
      "translation": "说到底，全都是因为修恩扎伊特那家伙杀害了女王陛下。",
      "translation_sha256": "58a0b102d821403938082cbc18e00832fae2f4adf4b2435b8336039daad2f782"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:66f23d7b6531e2a09cf6bd472f2e131c501de10540e530b2dd6b9d3713aaccd0",
      "source": "라티 족에게 빼앗기지만 않았어도...\\n지금 이 채굴장은 그다지 생산량이\\n많지 않아 걱정이야.",
      "translation": "要是没被拉提族夺走就好了……现在这个采掘场的产量不高，真让人担心。",
      "translation_sha256": "0e3e7038b8bfe12545c6a9303043657d5de8228970d9ca43b552585625fc1448"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f05fd4b5ce715bb185e9c1f3b142795c70266d1b0390fc46f7dfb980b5cbcf54",
      "source": "높새바람 섬이 북부군에게 점령당했다는\\n소문을 들었는데...",
      "translation": "我听说，风息岛被北部军占领了……",
      "translation_sha256": "27703f91db3c4d95385d17b955e067573e1445bd4d7ccc9b0c4a3d082defde04"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:19f61be028fff9faf5770c7485cb315b3b3e30df4d1fc325364a43f5a09846cf",
      "source": "그곳에 있는 내 아내와 딸은\\n어떻게 되었을까...",
      "translation": "我在那里的妻子和女儿，不知道怎么样了……",
      "translation_sha256": "3e8fb1d87b201a88d3380c9b7983c867f79edce8b151a60fc40adeae4615f5fb"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:f23acf79a26c176a1a44fb3c50c8fecccd8ea335f59d0d9a19631bfbfeb76718",
      "source": "꼭 무사히 살아 돌아와야 해.\\n죽지마. 흑흑...",
      "translation": "一定要平安回来。别死啊，呜呜……",
      "translation_sha256": "43b8e34da0c9a083ec3b21db8e0c10f48d51e95d319f771353ba9df0c77b40b1"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:59475c6a5039d77c56918cc7ef5427ba27198e5da6728a5041b85d97751b6b67",
      "source": "정말 못살겠어요.\\n남편이 왜 이렇게 무능한지...",
      "translation": "这日子真没法过了。我丈夫怎么这么没用……",
      "translation_sha256": "d4943c6b83119d2ec59fb8ff910d9ab2765b81d8f24dc52cab974689aaec5404"
    },
    {
      "id": "coalesced:93d6d893b0b20a027ac642f45be42389dd89e537dcf8c0877127d173360583f3",
      "source": "정말 죽겠군.\\n왜 이렇게 바가지를 긁어대는지 원.",
      "translation": "真是受不了了。怎么就这么爱唠叨呢。",
      "translation_sha256": "9f6d1f1a7e9c5997048caa0bbd789a8876781fb38a223f305dc07a6821cb1ec4"
    }
  ],
